## Image Registry and Pull Secrets

All sub-charts follow the [SUSE Application Collection](https://dp.apps.rancher.io) standardization
for `global.imageRegistry` and `global.imagePullSecrets`.

### global.imageRegistry

Override the container registry for **every** component image in one place:

```yaml
global:
  imageRegistry: "my-registry.example.com"
```

Precedence: `global.imageRegistry` → per-component `image.registry` → no prefix.

### global.imagePullSecrets

Inject pull secrets into every pod. Accepts both string and object formats:

```yaml
global:
  imagePullSecrets:
    - name: my-pull-secret
```

Chart-level `imagePullSecrets` (under a sub-chart's values root) act as a fallback when
`global.imagePullSecrets` is empty.

## Installing the Chart

```bash
helm install kubeflow oci://dp.apps.rancher.io/charts/kubeflow \
  --namespace kubeflow \
  --set global.imagePullSecrets[0].name=application-collection
```

To mirror all images through a private registry:

```bash
helm install kubeflow oci://dp.apps.rancher.io/charts/kubeflow \
  --namespace kubeflow \
  --set global.imageRegistry=my-registry.example.com \
  --set global.imagePullSecrets[0].name=my-pull-secret
```

